  "question": {
    "text": "Consider reaction,<br />\r<br />\r<math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>CaCO</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mo>s</mo> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>⇌</mo> <mtext>CaO</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mo>s</mo> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mtext>CO</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>g</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br />\r<br />\rIn a closed container at equilibrium. What would be the effect of addition of <math >\r <mrow>\r  <msub>\r   <mrow>\r    <mtext>CaCO</mtext></mrow>\r   <mn>3</mn>\r  </msub>\r  </mrow>\r</math>\r on the equilibrium concentration of <math>\r <mrow>\r  <msub>\r   <mrow>\r    <mtext>CO</mtext></mrow>\r   <mtext>2</mtext>\r  </msub>\r  <mtext>&#x2009;</mtext><mtext>?</mtext></mrow>\r</math>\r"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Increases",
      "is_correct": false
    },
